你们应该没有接触过总部的避雨程序吧？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"9":{"step":[[9,10,""]],"type":1,"name":["帕拉维扬","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613701456","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["是的，这是我第一次在基金会总部执勤。我们应该做什么？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"10":{"step":[[10,11,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥斯本队长","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"534202.png","audio":"613701840","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["雨前反应部队的职责是在开启人员收容程序时，为基金会总部提供机动性武装力量。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"11":{"step":[[11,12,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥斯本队长","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"534202.png","audio":"613701841","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["我们的顶头上司是雨前调度中心，每次“暴雨”前24小时，他们都会接管基金会的主要军事和安保力量。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"12":{"step":[[12,13,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥斯本队长","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"534202.png","audio":"613701842","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["不过这一次总部的情况比过去任何时候都要复杂，所以我们不得不动用所有能找到的人手。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"13":{"step":[[13,14,""]],"type":1,"name":["叶尔莫莱","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613701477","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["呵，在哪儿不是干活呢。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"14":{"step":[[14,15,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥斯本队长","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"534202.png","audio":"613701843","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["有心理准备就好。过来，我在路上给你们说明情况。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"15":{"step":[[15,57,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/jijinhuizoulang2.jpg","choice":[]},"16":{"step":[[16,17,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["面向北方的宏伟门扉历经时代变迁仍不失光洁，在倾斜的阳光下，它向地面投下沉重的阴影。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/jijinhuidatang.jpg","choice":[]},"17":{"step":[[17,18,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["在历次“暴雨”前夕，它都是外来人员合法进入基金会的唯一通道。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/jijinhuidatang.jpg","choice":[]},"18":{"step":[[18,19,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["在门外，等待收容的人们排成一条惴惴不安的漫长队伍，像病弱的蛇一般蜷缩在白色高墙的根部。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"19":{"step":[[19,20,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥斯本队长","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"534202.png","audio":"613701844","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["看见这些人了吗？感谢《收容人员扩大决议》，这次“暴雨”前，进入基金会的人比过去要多了起码十倍。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"20":{"step":[[20,21,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥斯本队长","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"534202.png","audio":"613701845","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["军人、精神病学家、理论物理学家，甚至还有带案底的“灰色人员”……有人简直想一次性搬空整个时代的人才库。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"21":{"step":[[21,22,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥斯本队长","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"534202.png","audio":"613701846","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["这些来自本时代的收容对象大多还不了解“暴雨”，基金会是用其他理由让他们来总部的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"22":{"step":[[22,23,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥斯本队长","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"534202.png","audio":"613701847","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["但我们不能忽视重塑之手的宣传，尤其是在这个战乱的年代，有不少人会想方设法混进来避雨。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"23":{"step":[[23,24,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥斯本队长","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"534202.png","audio":"613701848","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["你们的工作就是配合安检系统，阻止没有资质的人进入总部。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"24":{"step":[[24,25,""]],"type":1,"name":["帕拉维扬","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613701457","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["如果我们抓到了这些人，是应该把他们送去监禁室吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"25":{"step":[[25,26,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥斯本队长","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"534202.png","audio":"613701849","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["当然不是，监禁室只会让他们得偿所愿——这些人可以顺势在监禁室里躲过“暴雨”。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"26":{"step":[[26,27,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥斯本队长","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"534202.png","audio":"613701850","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["合规的做法是把这些人撵出去。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"27":{"step":[[27,28,""]],"type":1,"name":["帕拉维扬","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613701458","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["撵出去？如果他们只是想避雨，为什么不让他们……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"28":{"step":[[28,29,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥斯本队长","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"534202.png","audio":"613701851","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["因为我们无法确认他们的真实目的。何况这次收容人员过多，很多人都没来得及接受可靠的背景调查。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"29":{"step":[[29,58,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥斯本队长","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"534202.png","audio":"613702532","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["宽容是一个危险的词，年轻人。我们面对的是严肃的秩序问题：<br>有这一次，是不是还有下一次？有这个人，是不是还有下一个人？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"30":{"step":[[30,31,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["帕拉维扬还想说些什么，但叶尔莫莱一把按住了他的肩膀，示意他不要再多说。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"31":{"step":[[31,32,""]],"type":1,"name":["叶尔莫莱","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613701478","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["抱歉，这小子其实对基金会的做法并没有异议，我也一样。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"32":{"step":[[32,33,""]],"type":1,"name":["叶尔莫莱","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613701479","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我们会遵循总部一以贯之的收容准则——“致谢，行礼，目送。决不惊扰登记者的后续生活。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"33":{"step":[[33,34,""]],"type":1,"name":["帕拉维扬","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"34":{"step":[[34,35,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥斯本队长","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"534202.png","audio":"613701853","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["你们明白就好。基金会是航行在洪水中的方舟，只有秩序能保护我们抵达终点。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"35":{"step":[[35,36,""]],"type":1,"name":["？？？","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"611701.png","audio":"613701816","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["放我进去！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"36":{"step":[[36,37,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["入口处的人群里传来一声喊叫，接着是激烈的肢体碰撞声。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_5/1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.jpg","choice":[]},"37":{"step":[[37,38,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["奥斯本队长平静地向骚乱的来源转过头。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_5/1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.jpg","choice":[]},"38":{"step":[[38,39,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥斯本队长","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"534202.png","audio":"613701854","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"n